The image built from this directory also contains, fetched at build time and
never committed:
- the AnkiConnect add-on (GPL-3.0-or-later, Copyright Alex Yatskov and
  contributors), source and pin in ADDON_PIN; its license text is installed
  next to it as addons21/2055492159/LICENSE.upstream;
- Anki's desktop package aqt (AGPL-3.0-or-later), PyQt6 (GPL-3.0) and Qt 6
  (LGPL-3.0/GPL), pinned in requirements.lock.
The image is built locally and never pushed to a registry (R1869).
